*.lo
.cxx/
/obj/
/libs/

# ─── Model weights: never commit a GGUF ───────────────────────────────────────
# The weights are downloaded at runtime into the app's documents directory.
#
# `models/` was previously unanchored here, which silently excluded the Dart
# source directory `lib/models/` from every commit — git says nothing when an
# ignore rule swallows a source folder, so the only symptom was a CI build with
# an unresolved `package:k100/models/...` import. Every generated-artifact rule
# below is therefore anchored, and the `Repository sanity` CI step fails if a
# source path under lib/ is ever ignored again.
*.gguf
*.ggml
*.part
/models/
/android/app/src/main/assets/models/
/assets/models/

# ─── Signing & secrets ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.jks
*.p12
*.pem
key.properties
secrets.properties

# ─── Editors / OS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
